{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nidhogg is the epic award-winning fencing tug-of-war, full of graceful acrobatics and clumsy stabs. IRL yelling and excitement may occur, in this ultimate two-player showdown of fast-paced fencing and melee attacks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware, advantages in Nidhogg are often fleeting, as new opponents continually spawn in your way.  Use a variety of fencing maneuvers while armed -- lunges, parries, and even dirty tricks like throwing your sword.  If swordless, press forward with punches, sweep kicks, dive kicks, rolls, and wall jumps. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combat arena stretches in both directions, although besting an opponent only gains you ground. Matches aren\u2019t won or lost with a single kill, but with a series of kills granting you right-of-way to run/fight/flee to your own goal-zone. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each arena holds different strategic formations and chokepoints to use to your advantage.  Until you reach your goal-zone, anything is possible. Only one thing is certain in Nidhogg\u2026 the only way to win is to outwit your opponent. En Garde!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"FLESH AND BLOOD","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/94400/184ec506db34a763d5348ae5df695592bd2d6c6c.jpg"},{"name":"PERFECT STRIDE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/94400/04f8d2b619bca04f8dd0f2ee1bd58108f698c36c.jpg"},{"name":"HOGGLIKE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/94400/80a0ddde76bb7a3a3467f42a97a1462b3ab0406a.jpg"},{"name":"BLOODLUST","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/94400/7124a78cc3ebfdf88e81e7a8aa726693abb32925.jpg"},{"name":"TRAPPED IN DONKEYSPACE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/